{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1486409-player-s-guide-saints-monsters-feedback","id":1486409,"title":"Player's Guide: Saints & Monsters Feedback","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-07-14T06:38:09-07:00","id":1486409,"title":"Player's Guide: Saints & Monsters Feedback","content":"So i didn't see one here yet, so i wanted to give a topic for feedback on the product. If there's an official one, i'll take this down!<br /> <br /> So, in addition to my question about the Magic Purview and Dominion, i had another thing i wanted to bring up:<br /> <br /> In the Titanic Scions section, the rules only mentions Titanomancy once, as an optional book. The problem is.... the titanic callings are in that book, so I think we might need more a callback to Titanomancy, or at least cut n paste the Callings into here. The Callings in Titanomancy has the skills, deeds, fatebindings, etc, for Heroic+ Scions. Might be important to at least put a reference to Titanomancy for the fuuuulll Heroic+ Scion rules for their Callings, especially since Knacks were cut n paste from that book too (as far as i can tell anyway).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3071,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3071-magusrogue","user":"MagusRogue","date":". 07-14-2022, 10:52 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3071-magusrogue","name":"MagusRogue","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3071_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"53"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-14T07:51:53-07:00","id":1486417,"title":"","content":"As I read this book more, there's really no rules at all for Demigod-Tier games beyond titanic scions. I was remise to see no Demigod-level Kitsune rules in Demigod and was hoping to see Demigod-level rules here, especially with the new Magic and Denizen purviews in this book.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3071-magusrogue","name":"MagusRogue","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3071_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"53"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-14T09:19:23-07:00","id":1486430,"title":"","content":"I haven\u2019t read everything yet, but Saints go up to Demigod tier. As for Denizens, generally the ones who are punching at Demigod tier are going to be Scions in their own right. A Kitsune who keeps pace with the divinely endowed is probably a Scion of Inari, or if malicious Tamamo (aka Da Ji). Echidna exists as a Titanic parent for those monstrous beings who hold their own with Greek Demigods, etc.<br /> <br /> edit: or Saint I suppose. I don\u2019t think anything prohibits one of a Saint\u2019s three Callings from being a Denizen calling","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":1098,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","user":"glamourweaver","date":". 07-14-2022, 12:43 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-14T15:33:48-07:00","id":1486468,"title":"","content":"A saint who is also non-human drive requires explicit permission from the other players. That is, it isn't strictly forbidden; but it is discouraged.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-14T15:45:48-07:00","id":1486470,"title":"","content":"Yeah, by my read though it shouldn\u2019t be unbalanced. A Saint/Scion certainly is but a Denizen-Saint should work as well as a Denizen-Scion does.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-16T10:41:58-07:00","id":1486641,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1486409-player-s-guide-saints-monsters-feedback?p=1486430#post1486430\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I haven\u2019t read everything yet, but Saints go up to Demigod tier. As for Denizens, generally the ones who are punching at Demigod tier are going to be Scions in their own right. A Kitsune who keeps pace with the divinely endowed is probably a Scion of Inari, or if malicious Tamamo (aka Da Ji). Echidna exists as a Titanic parent for those monstrous beings who hold their own with Greek Demigods, etc.<br /> <br /> edit: or Saint I suppose. I don\u2019t think anything prohibits one of a Saint\u2019s three Callings from being a Denizen calling</div> </div> </div> </div>There can be demigod level Denizens that are not scions. The Hero book states this, and then give as an example the Kitsune, how they gain a tail every 100 years and how they increase in Legend for every tail up to 9 without needing the involvement of a God.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1351-sakii","name":"Sakii","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1351_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1319"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-16T11:26:06-07:00","id":1486644,"title":"","content":"I admittedly wish they\u2019d move all of the (really good!) consent guidelines in the Denizen chapter to a dedicated Storyguiding advise book, and use that space for more rules clarification.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-16T15:00:25-07:00","id":1486677,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1486409-player-s-guide-saints-monsters-feedback?p=1486644#post1486644\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I admittedly wish they\u2019d move all of the (really good!) consent guidelines in the Denizen chapter to a dedicated Storyguiding advise book, and use that space for more rules clarification.</div> </div> </div> </div>You are not wrong, but more people are going to buy and read that book than a storyguiding book.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </s